                                "sense_id": "1d3f5508-dec4-34b6-b00a-d6bbb03df5e1",
                                "text": "Many who have \"plied their book diligently,\" and know all about some one branch or another of accepted lore, come out of the study with an ancient and owl-like demeanour, and prove dry, stockish, and dyspeptic in all the better and brighter parts of life."
